---
// The public Study Plan (smetase-web StudyPlanView) on a phone, over a textured portrait.
---

<section class="parents" id="parents" aria-labelledby="parents-title">
  <div class="parents__copy">
    <h2 id="parents-title" class="parents__title display" data-split>
      Show your parents <span class="light">the plan.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="body-lg" data-rise>
      One link with the programme, the real tuition, what's still needed and who your advisor is. They can open it
      without signing in, on any phone.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="parents__visual">
    <figure class="parents__photo tex" data-texture="dots" data-parallax="10">
      <img
        src="/images/phone.webp"
        alt="A young man in a burgundy suit smiling at his phone"
        width="1400"
        height="934"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="-8">
      <div class="phone__screen">
        <p class="sp__brand">smetase</p>
        <p class="sp__title">Study plan for Ada</p>
        <p class="sp__muted">Prepared 12 Oct 2026</p>

        <p class="sp__k">The programme</p>
        <p class="sp__strong">MSc Data Science and Computational Intelligence</p>
        <p class="sp__muted">Coventry University · Coventry, UK</p>
        <p class="sp__small">1 year · Starts September 2027 or January 2028</p>

        <p class="sp__k">Cost</p>
        <div class="sp__row"><span>Tuition</span><span class="mono">£19,500</span></div>
        <div class="sp__row sp__row--total"><span>Total</span><span class="mono">£19,500</span></div>
        <p class="sp__check">✓ Tuition checked against Coventry University's own course page.</p>

        <p class="sp__k">Requirements</p>
        <p class="sp__ok">✓ Degree in a related subject</p>
        <p class="sp__warn">△ Still needed: English test result</p>

        <p class="sp__k">Next steps</p>
        <p class="sp__step"><b>1</b> Pay the deposit <i>by 30 Nov</i></p>
        <p class="sp__step"><b>2</b> Book the English test <i>this month</i></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .parents {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 120px);
    padding: clamp(100px, 16vh, 180px) var(--gutter);
    background: var(--subtle);
  }
  .parents__title {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 108px);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .parents__visual {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 640px;
  }
  .parents__photo {
    position: absolute;
    margin: 0;
    inset: 0 0 0 18%;
  }
  .phone {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 50%;
    width: 300px;
    margin-top: -300px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 44px;
    background: var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
  .phone__screen {
    height: 580px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 34px;
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 34px 20px 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .sp__brand {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .sp__title {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .sp__muted {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .sp__k {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .sp__strong {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .sp__small {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .sp__row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sp__row--total {
    border: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sp__check {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .sp__ok {
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: #15803d;
  }
  .sp__warn {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: #b45309;
  }
  .sp__step {
    margin-top: 6px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .sp__step b {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .sp__step i {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .parents {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .parents__visual {
      min-height: 600px;
    }
    .parents__photo {
      inset: 0 0 0 30%;
    }
  }
</style>
